.TH PLATEFOLD-DESKTOP 1 "" "Plate|Fold" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
platefold-desktop \- desktop app for rendering documents to PDF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B platefold\-desktop
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B platefold\-desktop
opens the Plate|Fold window. Choose documents and an output folder, adjust
paper, theme and layout with a live preview of the first page, and export
PDFs. It takes no options; the
.BR platefold (1)
command offers the same exports from a terminal.
.PP
A copy installed from this package is updated by installing the next
release's .deb; the app's Updates dialog says when one is available.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR platefold (1)
.PP
https://maxfield-allison.github.io/platefold/
